  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNODC&apos;s Strategic Framework 2023-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary contribution towards UNODC&apos;s Stratergy 2021-2026 with soft thematic earmarking. Thematic areas that will be supported: Cybercrime, Money Laundering, Proceeds of Crime and the Financing of Terrorism, Preventing and countering Terrorism, Crime prevention and Criminal Justice and Maritime crime.</narrative>
  </description>
